msgstr "可能无法发送电子邮件通知"

msgid "This form's email notification feature is enabled, but email delivery has not been verified and the latest spam score is %s/100. The form was saved, but admin notification emails may not reach you until SMTP/email delivery is fixed."
msgstr "此表单的电子邮件通知功能已启用,但电子邮件发送尚未经过验证,最新垃圾邮件评分为%s/100。表单已保存,但在修复 SMTP/电子邮件传递之前,您可能无法收到管理员通知电子邮件。"

msgid "Notification emails are turned off"
msgstr "通知电子邮件已关闭"

