msgstr "连接一个或多个 Google 服务帐户 - 无需登录浏览器"

msgid "Your server is missing the PHP OpenSSL extension."
msgstr "您的服务器缺少 PHP OpenSSL 扩展。"

msgid "Google Sheet sync cannot work until it is enabled. Please ask your host to enable the %s PHP extension, then reload this page."
msgstr "Google 表格同步在启用之前无法工作。请要求您的主机启用%sPHP 扩展,然后重新加载此页面。"

