msgid "The last delivery check scored %s out of 100. Your messages do leave the site, but most mailboxes will file them as spam, so the people filling in your forms will not see them. Sending through an SMTP service, and adding SPF and DKIM records for your domain, is what fixes this."
msgstr "最后一次投递检查的得分为%s(满分 100)。您的邮件确实离开了该网站,但大多数邮箱会将它们归档为垃圾邮件,因此填写您表单的人不会看到它们。通过 SMTP 服务发送并为您的域添加 SPF 和 DKIM 记录即可解决此问题。"

msgid "The last delivery check found that your messages do leave the site, but mailboxes file them as spam. Sending through an SMTP service, and adding SPF and DKIM records for your domain, is what fixes this."
msgstr "最后一次递送检查发现您的邮件确实离开了站点,但邮箱将它们归档为垃圾邮件。通过 SMTP 服务发送并为您的域添加 SPF 和 DKIM 记录即可解决此问题。"

msgid "Your form emails are going to the spam folder"
msgstr "您的表单电子邮件将进入垃圾邮件文件夹"

msgid "Your form emails are sent, but they are not arriving"
msgstr "您的表单电子邮件已发送,但尚未到达"

msgid "WordPress sent the last test message successfully, so your site and this plugin did their part - it was lost, delayed or rejected after leaving WordPress. Usually the receiving mailbox treated it as spam, or your host never delivered it from the outbound queue. Sending through an SMTP service, with SPF and DKIM records for your domain, is what fixes this."
msgstr "WordPress 成功发送了最后一条测试消息,因此您的网站和此插件发挥了作用 - 离开 WordPress 后消息丢失、延迟或被拒绝。通常,接收邮箱将其视为垃圾邮件,或者您的主机从未从出站队列中传递它。通过 SMTP 服务发送,并使用您的域的 SPF 和 DKIM 记录,可以解决此问题。"

msgid "WordPress cannot send your form emails"
msgstr "WordPress 无法发送您的表单电子邮件"

msgid "The last check could not even hand a message to your mail server: WordPress reported an error while sending, so nothing left the site. An SMTP plugin, or asking your host whether PHP mail is disabled, is where to start."
